 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” HVAC company for every Atlanta home, but **Coolray** is a reasonable first company to get a quote from: the available installation reviews include positive feedback about its replacement process. **Reliable Heating & Air** is another option to compare; it says it has served the area since 1978 and reports a large volume of customer reviews.\n\nBefore choosing, get **at least three written quotes** and compare more than the equipment brand. Ask each contractor to assess your home’s cooling load, explain the proposed system size, itemize labor and equipment, and spell out warranties and permit handling. Check recent reviews and verify the contractor’s Georgia license and insurance. A low bid that skips a proper load calculation or gives vague installation details may cost more in comfort and repairs later.",
